T21:47:37Z","body":">  is it a problem with debugging generally\n\nNo because generally I'm able to get back to the editor. Only during startup and when an error occurs I can't get back. Something is happening during the loading screen to prevent me from using my hands.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3667337631/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]